              <tr><td style=\'padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background: #f8f9fa;\'><strong>Total Vacancies:</strong></td><td style=\'padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\'>20 Technicians</td></tr>\n                </table>\n                <p>The candidate matching algorithm is actively scanning qualified ITI batches for your requisition.</p>\n                        <div style=\'text-align: center; margin: 25px 0;\'>\n                <a href=\'/views/industry/requirements.php\' style=\'background: #0d2847; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\'>View in PRAYAS Portal</a>\n            </div>\n                        <hr style=\'border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; margin: 30px 0;\'>\n                        <p style=\'font-size: 12px; color: #777777; margin-bottom: 0;\'>\n                            This is an automated system notification from PRAYAS Industry Manpower Portal. Please do not reply directly to this email. For assistance, reach out to support@prayas-academy.org.\n                        </p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </table>\n        </body>\n        </html>','PRAYAS – The Automation Academy\nIndustry Manpower Requirement Portal\n========================================\n\nSubject: Requirement Auto-Approved: REQ-202611-0119 — PRAYAS\n\nDear PRAYAS Master Administrator,\n\nPlease log in to the PRAYAS Manpower Portal to review your notifications and requirement updates.\n\nPortal URL: /views/industry/requirements.php\n\nRegards,\nPRAYAS Academic Administration\n','SIMULATED','Email simulation active (mail_enabled=0). Message recorded to audit log.',0,NULL,'2026-11-06 08:08:53'),(135,'hr@absolutemotion.in',251,'Requirement Submitted for Review: REQ-202611-0127 — PRAYAS','requirement_submission','<!DOCTYPE html>\n        <html>\n        <head>\n            <meta charset=\'UTF-8\'>\n            <title>Requirement Submitted f